abstract: >
  TGT (Transcription Glossing Translation) is an end-to-end system
  designed to support linguistic data processing workflows.
  This software was developed within the ERC-funded project
  "LeibnizDream - Realizing Leibniz’s Dream: Child Languages as a Mirror of the Mind"
  (Grant Agreement No. 856421).
